a Gosvāmī"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["rādhe jaya jaya mādhava-dayite","gokula-taruṇī-maṇḍala-mahite"],"translation":["Ak, Rādha, Madhavas mīļotā! Tevi pielūdz visas jaunās meitas Gokulā! Visa slava Tev! Visa slava Tev!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["dāmodara-rati-vardhana-veśe","hari-niṣkuṭa-vṛndā-vipineśe"],"translation":["Tu, kas greznojas tā, lai arvien vairotu Kunga Dāmodara mīlestību un pieķeršanos. Ak, Vrindāvanas karaliene, Kunga Harī prieka un rotaļu birzs."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vṛṣabhānūdadhi-nava-śaśi-lekhe","lalitā-sakhi guṇa-ramita-viśākhe"],"translation":["Ak, jaunais mēness, kas uzausis no ķēniņa Vrišabhānu okeāna. Ak, Lalitas tuvā draudzene. Ak, tu, kuras brīnišķīgais draudzīgums, maigums un uzticība Krišnam ir padarījusi Višākhu par tavu uzticīgo pavadoni."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["karuṇāṁ kuru moyi karuṇā-bhorite","sanaka-sanātana-varṇita-charite"],"translation":["Ak, līdzjūtības pilnā. Ak, tu, kuras dievišķās īpašības apdzied diženi gudrie Sanaka un Sanātana. Ak, Rādha, lūdzu, esi žēlsirdīga pret mani."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-radhe-jaya","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/acharyamaharaj/sri-radhika-stava","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.P. Janardan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/janardan-maharaj-radhe-jaya","personSlug":"srila-b-p-janardan-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-radhe-jaya","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/radhe-jaya-jaya","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Bhakti Lalita Devi","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bhakti-lalita-devi/bhakti-lalita-devi-sri-radhika-stava","personSlug":"bhakti-lalita-devi"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/radhe-jaya-jaya-madhava-dayite/","description":"Śrī Rādhikā-stava — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Šrīla Rūpa Gosvāmī. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Śrī Rādhikā-stava. Šrīla Rūpa Gosvāmī | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"radhe-jaya-jaya-madhava-dayite"}}